# LEOS (Lattice Effective Oxidation States) patch for VASP 6.4.3
#
# Features:
#   - Core LEOS algorithm: Wannier-centre counting + IUPAC(2014) rule
#   - Hungarian (Jonker-Volgenant) global optimal assignment (EOS_USE_HUNGARIAN)
#   - dOS covalency descriptor output
#   - Trajectory mode: per-step analysis (EOS_EVERY_N)
#   - Improved auto-window detection for Wannier90 (mlwf.F)
#
# Apply:  cd vasp.6.4.3 && git apply ../patches/leos.patch
# Files:  .objects, eos.F (new), main.F, mlwf.F
#
